@api = http://localhost:5200

### Create a circle geofence (id generated when omitted)
POST {{api}}/api/geofences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "circle",
  "name": "Central Station",
  "center": { "latitude": 52.3791, "longitude": 4.9003 },
  "radiusMeters": 400
}

### Create or replace a polygon geofence with a chosen id
PUT {{api}}/api/geofences/museum-quarter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "polygon",
  "name": "Museum quarter",
  "vertices": [
    { "latitude": 52.3615, "longitude": 4.8770 },
    { "latitude": 52.3615, "longitude": 4.8870 },
    { "latitude": 52.3560, "longitude": 4.8870 },
    { "latitude": 52.3560, "longitude": 4.8770 }
  ]
}

### List geofences
GET {{api}}/api/geofences

### Delete a geofence
DELETE {{api}}/api/geofences/museum-quarter

### Latest position of one device
GET {{api}}/api/devices/sim-0001/position

### Devices within 2 km of Dam Square that reported in the last minute
GET {{api}}/api/devices/nearby?lat=52.3731&lon=4.8926&radiusMeters=2000&limit=20&maxAgeSeconds=60

### Recent geofence alerts
GET {{api}}/api/alerts?limit=20

### Distance per UTC day for one device (defaults to the last 7 days)
GET {{api}}/api/analytics/devices/sim-0001/distance?from=2026-10-20&to=2026-10-27

### Time spent inside each geofence (defaults to the last 24 hours)
GET {{api}}/api/analytics/devices/sim-0001/geofence-time

### Dwell events (visits longer than Analytics:DwellThreshold) in the last 7 days
GET {{api}}/api/analytics/dwell-events?geofenceId=sim-center&limit=20
